sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    Note over P,UI: Only after UC-01: with no track loaded the selectors are empty.
    P->>UI: choose a line, then a wayside
    UI->>S: selectLine(name) / selectController(id)
    alt unknown wayside
        S-->>UI: KeyError, selection unchanged
    else a wayside of a loaded line
        S->>M: controllers[id]
        M-->>S: TrackController
        S->>W: program, file_name, iteration
        W-->>S: committed program, or none
        S->>S: buffer := committed source, or empty
        Note right of S: Uncommitted edits in the editor are discarded.
        S-->>UI: selection, buffer, controller changed
        UI-->>P: editor, file list, block grid and header for this wayside
    end
